Third-party data

The MIT licence above covers the code and the writing in this repository. It
does not cover data that other people own. Their terms apply to it:

- USDA FoodData Central SR Legacy and the USDA Table of Nutrient Retention
  Factors, Release 6: public domain (CC0). Most of data/foods.json is built
  from these.
- Indian Food Composition Tables 2017 (IFCT 2017), Longvah T, Ananthan R,
  Bhaskarachary K, Venkaiah K. National Institute of Nutrition (ICMR),
  Hyderabad. Copyright ICMR-NIN. Two rows of data/foods.json, paneer (IFCT
  L003) and jaggery (IFCT I001), are taken from it with acknowledgement. NIN
  asks for written permission before its data is reproduced electronically in
  a product. Anyone reusing those two rows needs that permission for
  themselves.
- ICMR-NIN Nutrient Requirements for Indians (2020) and Dietary Guidelines for
  Indians (2024): cited for the daily targets and the standard katori sizes.
  Only the individual figures are used, not the text or tables.
- The hostel menus in data/field/menus/ are transcriptions of menus the
  colleges publish on their own websites. Each one's source is listed in
  data/field/menus/SOURCES.csv. The menus belong to those institutions.
